==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Zebstrika|49}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
*'''Head Bolt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Manectric|44}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus|Arceus}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

